{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BURN THE WITCH</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear Calamity is a top-down psychological and survival horror, you're stuck on a shifting labyrinth with a <strong>relentless immortal monster</strong>, while managing your <i>light levels, hunger, exhaustion</i> trying not to lead the creature directly to you with your blood and sounds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/a61af0925c16dea977a67a4eda3e5c0b.poster.avif?t=1754505107\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/a61af0925c16dea977a67a4eda3e5c0b.webm?t=1754505107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/a61af0925c16dea977a67a4eda3e5c0b.mp4?t=1754505107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond managing your backpack, <u><i>every bad thing that happens to you also get rid of precious space on what you may hold.</i></u><br>Be careful on what your eyes may see, as your own <strong>paranoia</strong> and <strong>stress</strong> increase to the brink of a <strong>heart attack</strong>.<br>Between each level, moments of strange events may unfold, your actions have consequences on the twisting corridors, even when you're not being observed... or when you <i>think</i> you're not being observed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/175df3e7697d17e6ca81351a13376953.poster.avif?t=1754505107\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/175df3e7697d17e6ca81351a13376953.webm?t=1754505107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/175df3e7697d17e6ca81351a13376953.mp4?t=1754505107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never accept a deal with an infinitely powerful cosmic entity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874220?t=1754505107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/48f7b6b03ae949439f80785945242448479141ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754505107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/0697ea3ff44156dfb6671c3cf7bdfd4e21eb25d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754505107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/0697ea3ff44156dfb6671c3cf7bdfd4e21eb25d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754505107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent blood, skeletons, mutilation, rotting, severed body parts."},"demos":[{"appid":2907530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BURN THE WITCH</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear Calamity is a top-down psychological and survival horror, you're stuck on a shifting labyrinth with a <strong>relentless immortal monster</strong>, while managing your <i>light levels, hunger, exhaustion</i> trying not to lead the creature directly to you with your blood and sounds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi